          <text x="409" y="35" fill="var(--muted)" font-size="8.5" text-anchor="middle" letter-spacing="0.5">EFFECTS UPDATE WORLD STATE — REPLANS IN PLACE WHEN THE PLAN NO LONGER HOLDS</text>

          <text x="20" y="225" fill="var(--fg)" font-size="10.5">No behavior tree to rewrite for every new case. Adding a mission means</text>
          <text x="20" y="243" fill="var(--fg)" font-size="10.5">authoring one more goal and one more action — the planner is generic over both.</text>
        </svg>
        <p class="mt-4 text-xs text-muted">{c.goapLede}</p>
